  "_readme": "33 kV PC. Copy this file next to SubstationOcr.exe and rename it node.config.json. Reads this PC's SECONDARY screen at :02 every hour and shows this PC's part of the logsheet - columns 9-24 - as an LS1 QR code on the MAIN screen when the operator holds Ctrl+Shift and presses 7, then 8, then 9 (each within three seconds). Runs 07:00 to 07:00, then stops until started again by hand. The 132 kV PC shows columns 1-8 in its own code; the phone merges the two scans. No network link is used.",
